{
  "name": "download",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "下载 Download",
  "description": "同时表达文件信息、下载进度与完成反馈的下载操作组件。",
  "import": "import { Download, downloadVariants } from \"@/components/ui/download\"",
  "exports": [
    "Download",
    "downloadVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "DownloadProps",
    "DownloadStatus"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "npx wui@latest add @wui/download",
    "shadcn": "npx shadcn@latest add http://localhost:3000/r/download.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "lucide-react",
      "class-variance-authority",
      "motion"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "filename",
      "type": "string",
      "required": true,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Main file label shown in the control."
    },
    {
      "name": "meta",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Secondary metadata such as file type and size."
    },
    {
      "name": "fileIcon",
      "type": "ReactNode",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "File type icon inferred from the filename. Pass a node to override it or false to hide it."
    },
    {
      "name": "href",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Direct URL downloaded when the control is activated."
    },
    {
      "name": "status",
      "type": "\"idle\" | \"downloading\" | \"complete\" | \"error\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "idle",
        "downloading",
        "complete",
        "error"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "\"idle\"",
      "description": "Visual lifecycle state."
    },
    {
      "name": "progress",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "control": "number",
      "defaultValue": "0",
      "description": "Determinate progress from 0 to 100."
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"compact\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "compact"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Height and spacing preset."
    },
    {
      "name": "onDownload",
      "type": "(() => void | Promise<void>)",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "description": "Called when the user requests the download."
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Download` 将文件身份、体积、进度和操作反馈收拢到一个明确的下载入口。它适合资源包、报告、媒体与导出文件；只有一个简单小文件时，普通 Button 搭配下载图标通常更合适。\n\n传入 `href` 可直接触发浏览器下载；需要请求接口或生成文件时使用 `onDownload`。业务方可通过 `status` 与 `progress` 精确控制下载生命周期。\n\n组件默认根据 `filename` 的后缀显示对应的 Lucide 文件图标。通过 `fileIcon` 可传入自定义图标，或传入 `false` 隐藏图标。",
  "extended": "### 紧凑尺寸与状态\n\n`status` 支持 `idle`、`downloading`、`complete` 与 `error`；`progress` 接受 0–100 的数值。",
  "events": "- `onDownload()`：用户激活下载时调用，可返回 Promise。\n- 原生 `onFocus`、`onBlur` 等按钮事件会继续透传。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "download-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    },
    {
      "name": "download-states",
      "title": "紧凑尺寸与状态"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/download.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "http://localhost:3000/docs/components/download",
  "sourceUrl": "http://localhost:3000/r/download.json"
}
